SUMMARY:Earth Day Extravaganza
DESCRIPTION:Community members of all ages are invited to learn about environmental issues and solutions in a family-friendly atmosphere. \n\n\n\nOur host of eco-conscious contributors and entertainers will educate\, empower\, and inspire our community to welcome environmental-sustainability practices into their daily lives. \n\n\n\nEarth Day Extravaganza is (mostly) an outdoor event\, but we will bring it inside in the event of rain. This event will be held rain or shine! \n\n\n\nSCHEDULE♻ 10AM-2PM: Children’s Craft Tables \n\n\n\n♻ 10AM-2PM: Please Touch Table with Lancaster County Department of Parks & Recreation \n\n\n\n♻ 10AM-2PM: LPL Seed LibraryCheck out our seed library\, offering free seeds to anyone in the community! Vegetable\, herb\, and flower seeds are available. \n\n\n\n♻ 10AM-2PM: Book Swap TableWant to get rid of your old books sustainably? Come swap your pre-loved books for a new-to-you book from the Juliana Bookstore! \n\n\n\n♻ 10AM-2PM: Master GardenersLearn about native plants and their ecological benefits\, how to select ones appropriate for your landscape\, what to look for when buying them\, and other practical tips. \n\n\n\n♻ 10AM-2PM: Pennsylvania College of Art & DesignComplete a nature-related craft with our friends from PCAD. \n\n\n\n♻ 10:30AM: Canticuentos: Celebremos nuestra naturaleza¡Miss Vivi presenta Canticuentos! Disfruten en familia de un tiempo especial celebrando la cultura hispana con cuentos\, canciones y mucho más. Este programa se ofrece completamente en español. Community Room (library’s 1st floor) \n\n\n\n♻ 11:30AM: Your Street Trees and the Urban ForestTrees are critically important to our living in a healthy city\, not just in parks and yards\, but also along the streets and alleys. Learn about the benefits of street trees from the City of Lancaster’s Urban Forester. Community Room (library’s 1st floor) \n\n\n\n♻ 12:30PM: Earth Day StorytimeSpring into storytime with Miss Rachel during our annual celebration of Earth Day! Community Room (library’s 1st floor)
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/earth-day-extravaganza-3/
LOCATION:Lancaster Public Library\, 151 N. Queen Street\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Free Events and Activites
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitlancastercity.com/wp-content/uploads/cityoflancasterpa-242134369851055-6513947074125795354-Earth-Day-Extravaganza-FB.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster Public Library":MAILTO:lkaliss@lancasterpubliclibrary.org
GEO:40.0406753;-76.3037607
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Lancaster Public Library 151 N. Queen Street Lancaster 17603 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=151 N. Queen Street:geo:-76.3037607,40.0406753
END:VEVENT
